data: {"item":{"queries":["KSL Salt Lake City October 26 2026","FOX 13 Utah Salt Lake City October 26 2026","Salt Lake Tribune October 26 2026 Salt Lake City"],"results":[{"date":"2026-10-26","id":16,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex\n# Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex\nThe Complex\n536 West 100 South, Salt Lake City\nOct 26, 2026 at 7:00pm\nDinosaur Jr. bring the Fall Tour 2026 to The Complex on October 26th, 2026!\nS\u0026S Presents\nDinosaur Jr.\nWith Special Guest: Stef Chura\nMonday, October 26 Doors 7:00PM, Show 8:00PM All Ages\n...\n## Parking Information\nPublic parking is available at The Gateway, 1 block east of The Complex in the Summer or Winter parking garages.\nDiscounted all day parking vouchers can be purchased at The Complex concessions counter during any event for $5.\n($1 off if you’re a Complex Crew Pass holder)\n...\n## FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026\nOct26\n## Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex\nThe Complex\nSalt Lake City | 7:00pm","source":"web","title":"Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/592565?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":17,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Little Shop of Horrors | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Little Shop of Horrors\n# Little Shop of Horrors\nSimmons Pioneer Memorial Theatre - University of Utah\n300 South 1400 East, Salt Lake City\nOct 26, 2026 at 7:00pmSee Additional Dates\nFeed the plant…if you dare.\nLittle Shop of Horrors Book \u0026 Lyrics by Howard Ashman Music by Alan Menken Based on the film by Roger Corman | Screenplay by Charles Griffith October 23-November 7, 2026 Simmons Pioneer Memorial Theatre A Co-Production with Arizona Theatr\n## Ticket Information\nMain Floor/Loge: $89\nBalcony: $62\n...\n## Similar Events\nOct26\n## Little Shop of Horrors\nSimmons Pioneer Memorial Theatre - University of Utah\nSalt Lake City | 7:00pm","source":"web","title":"Little Shop of Horrors","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/573632?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":18,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Daily Organ Recitals on Temple Square | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Daily Organ Recitals on Temple Square\n# Daily Organ Recitals on Temple Square\nTabernacle on Temple Square\n50 West North Temple, Salt Lake City\nOct 26, 2026 at 12:00pmSee Additional Dates\nThe world famous organs on Temple Square are featured in daily concerts played by members of the organ staff and volunteer organists.\nFor over a century, visitors to Temple Square have been able to enjoy daily recitals featuring the famous pipe organs in the Tabernacle\n## Ticket Information\nFree Admission\n...\n## Sunday Organ Recitals on Temple Square\nOct26\n## Daily Organ Recitals on Temple Square\nTabernacle on Temple Square\nSalt Lake City | 12:00pm\nLearn More","source":"web","title":"Daily Organ Recitals on Temple Square","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/562687?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":19,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Treat Your Shelf Book Club | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Treat Your Shelf Book Club\n# Treat Your Shelf Book Club\nSalt Lake City Public Library Main Branch\n210 East 400 South, Salt Lake City\nOct 26, 2026 at 6:00pm\nA new book club for adults!\nMake friends, have a snack, and read and discuss a new book each month.\nClick for the book schedule!\nCopies of the next month’s book will be given out at each meeting.\nReading Schedule\n**Monday, October 26, 6-7:30pm · Educated by Tara Westover** **Mo**\n...\n## How the Hell Did I Get Here? by Jason Jacobson\nOct26\n## Treat Your Shelf Book Club\nSalt Lake City Public Library Main Branch\nSalt Lake City | 6:00pm","source":"web","title":"Treat Your Shelf Book Club","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/604819?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":20,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26 | KSL.com\n# Browse by Day Archive\n...\n# Salt Lake County prosecutors using AI to review evidence; DA says humans remain in control\n10/26/2026 6:20am\nAs prosecutors from across the country gather in Salt Lake City, officials are sharing how artificial intelligence is changing criminal investigations — and why they say safeguards are essential.\n# SpaceX enters $40 billion deal with Apollo for AI chip financing\n10/26/2026 6:07am\nSpaceX said on Monday an affiliate of Apollo ​Global Management will buy AI chips and server hardware and lease them to the ‌rockets-to-AI firm, in a deal with total principal payments of ⁠about $40 billion.\n# India's Tata Communications to spend $450 million on AI connectivity infrastructure\n10/26/2026 2:32am\nTata Communications, which ​offers data connections and cybersecurity to enterprises, ‌announced investments of close to $450 ⁠million on ​Monday to ⁠build high-speed network ‌cables connecting ‌India's AI data-centre corridors.\n‹ Previous day (10/25/2026)\n© 2026 KSL Media | KSL Broadcasting Salt Lake City UT | Site hosted \u0026 managed by KSL Media - a Deseret Media Company","source":"web","title":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26","url":"https://www.ksl.com/archive/2026/10/26/_news_utah_science-and-tech"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":21,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026 | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026\n# FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026\nVelour\n135 North University Avenue, Provo\nOct 26, 2026 at 11:00amSee Additional Dates\nOur filmfestival is 10 days of indie film celebration.\nCome join the fun and lose your mind this Holloween!\nFILMQUEST International Film Festival is a 501(c)(3) arts organization Celebrating our 13th Season this October in PROVO, UTAH!\n...\nOct26\n## Dinosaur Jr live at The Complex\nThe Complex\nSalt Lake City | 7:00pm\nLearn More\nOct26\n## FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026\nVelour\nProvo | 11:00am\nLearn More","source":"web","title":"FilmQuest International Film Festival 2026","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/602513?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":22,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"The Halloween Express 2026 | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Festivals \u0026 Special Events\n2. The Halloween Express 2026\n# The Halloween Express 2026\nHeber Valley Railroad\n450 South 600 West, Heber City\nOct 26, 2026 at 7:00pmSee Additional Dates\nJoin on this Halloween journey to the haunted Grim Hollow station.\nOn board you will be entertained by our hosts and a cast of characters!\nThis is a 90 minute family-friendly train experience.\nThe Halloween Express runs on Monday, Thursday, and Friday evenings throughout October.\nAll trains will sel\n## Ticket Information\n$35 - General Admission, ages 2+.\nYou'll ride in one of our standard historic coaches.\n$5 - Toddler Ticket, age 1 and under - must sit on a General Admission's lap.\nIncludes the cookie.\n...\nOct26\n## The Halloween Express 2026\nHeber Valley Railroad\nHeber City | 7:00pm\n...\nOct26\n## Ken Ludwig's Moriarty\nSorensen Legacy Jewel Box Stage\nSandy | 7:00pm","source":"web","title":"The Halloween Express 2026","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/593989?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":23,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"John O'Connell Exhibition/Tribute | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. John O'Connell Exhibition/Tribute\n# John O'Connell Exhibition/Tribute\nGittins Gallery\n375 South 1530 East, Salt Lake City\nOct 26, 2026 at 9:00amSee Additional Dates\nCelebrate the life and work of Department of Art \u0026 Art History's late Associate Professor of Painting and Drawing John O'Connell in a tribute exhibition, \"The Stories We Tell Ourselves.\"\n**Exhibition:** October 8–28, 2026 **Recepti**\n...\n## Ticket Information\nFree and open to the public.\n...\n## Similar Events\nOct26\n## John O'Connell Exhibition/Tribute\nGittins Gallery\nSalt Lake City | 9:00am","source":"web","title":"John O'Connell Exhibition/Tribute","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/599399?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":24,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Dine About Park City 2026 | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Dine About Park City 2026\n# Dine About Park City 2026\nPark City\n333 Historic Main Street, Park City\nOct 26, 2026 at 12:00pmSee Additional Dates\nOctober 1-31, 2026\nPark City’s favorite dining deal returns this October with more than 30 restaurants offering special prix fixe menus all month long.\nEnjoy seasonal dishes with two-course lunches for $15, $20, or $25 and three-course dinners for $30, $45, or $65.\n$20 après specials are also avail\n...\n## Dine About Park City 2026\nPark City\nPark City | 12:00pm","source":"web","title":"Dine About Park City 2026","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/602540?date=2026-10-26"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":25,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Expressions of the Soul Art Show | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Expressions of the Soul Art Show\n# Expressions of the Soul Art Show\nRed Cliff Gallery\n220 N 200 E, Saint George\nOct 26, 2026 at 9:00amSee Additional Dates\nExpressions of the Soul art show\nEXHIBITION OPEN TO PUBLIC\nFriday, September 11 through Thursday, October 29, Monday through Friday 9 am to 5 pm and Saturdays Noon to 4 pm at Red Cliff Gallery.\n## Parking Information\nFree Parking next to the Commons Building\n...\n## Expressions of the Soul Art Show\nSaint George | 12:00pm","source":"web","title":"Expressions of the Soul Art Show","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/593464?date=2026-10-26"},{"id":26,"last_updated":"2026-10-25","snippet":"Cornbelly's 2026 Pumpkin Fest in Spanish Fork | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Festivals \u0026 Special Events\n2. Cornbelly's 2026 Pumpkin Fest in Spanish Fork\n# Cornbelly's 2026 Pumpkin Fest in Spanish Fork\nCornbelly's Spanish Fork\n368