data: {"item":{"queries":["Salt Lake City police fire crash October 26 2026","Salt Lake City breaking incident October 26 2026","Salt Lake County crime news October 26 2026"],"results":[{"date":"2026-10-26","id":61,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City\n...\n# Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City\n...\nMon, October 26, 2026 at 1:42 AM UTC\n...\nSALT LAKE COUNTY, Utah (**ABC4**) — A man was was arrested in Salt Lake City for stalking, after following his ex-girlfriend from Alaska to Utah.\nSteven Samuelson, a 49 year-old male, was arrested on one count of stalking, a third-degree felony.\n...\nSalt Lake City Police arrived and detained Samuelson, and he revealed that he tracked the victim's vehicle through a small tracking device.\n...\nSamuelson is currently being held at the Salt Lake County jail without a bail.","source":"web","title":"Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/articles/man-stalks-ex-girlfriend-alaska-014246085.html"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":62,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Salt Lake City Shooting Suspect Charged Over Loud Music Fight\nMonday, October 26, 2026Set Location\nPublished 10 days ago • loading...\n• Updated 10 days ago\n# Salt Lake City Shooting Suspect Charged Over Loud Music Fight\nSummary by Hoodline\nMickey Bucio, 18, of Murray faces felony charges after a loud-music dispute near a Salt Lake City park ended with a 16-year-old shot.\n...\n#### Salt Lake City Shooting Suspect Charged Over Loud Music Fight\nMickey Bucio, 18, of Murray faces felony charges after a loud-music dispute near a Salt Lake City park ended with a 16-year-old shot.","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake City Shooting Suspect Charged Over Loud Music Fight","url":"https://ground.news/article/salt-lake-city-shooting-suspect-charged-over-loud-music-fight"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":63,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26 | KSL.com","source":"web","title":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26","url":"https://www.ksl.com/archive/2026/10/26/_news_utah_science-and-tech"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":64,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Man killed in police incident after hotel employees found him in West Valley outbuilding\nA man was shot and killed during an incident with police near a hotel in West Valley City.Officers with the West Valley City Police Department were called to th\n...\n## 2News Investigates\nOverheated power strip identified as cause of Riverdale fire that killed 5 family members\nAn overheated power strip has been blamed for a devastating house fire that killed five members of a Weber County family.Chief Matthew Hennessy withe the River","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake City News, Weather, Sports, Breaking News","url":"https://kutv.com/"},{"id":65,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"# Salt Lake County Breaking News \u0026 Latest Stories\n## Man dies after being shot by police outside of West Valley City hotel, police say\n...\n## Car fire at Salt Lake City International Airport damages 12 vehicles\n#### Joe R. Wirthlin Jr, KSL | Posted Oct. 23 - 4:01 p.m. | Save Story\n##### A car fire began early Friday morning at the Salt Lake City International Airport economy parking lot, damaging 12 vehicles. Fire officials are investigating the cause as an electrical malfunction.","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake County Breaking News \u0026 Local Stories","url":"https://www.ksl.com/news/utah/counties/salt-lake"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":66,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"West Valley City man killed in police involved incident\n...\n# West Valley City man killed in police involved incident\nKTVX Salt Lake City\nMon, October 26, 2026 at 1:55 AM UTC\n...\nA man was shot and killed in a police incident near a hotel after he was found in a storage building.","source":"web","title":"West Valley City man killed in police involved incident","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/news/videos/west-valley-city-man-killed-015531563.html"},{"date":"2026-10-16","id":67,"last_updated":"2026-10-22","snippet":"# Jordan Miller\n## Reporter\n#### He’s accused of murder in a Salt Lake City LDS church shooting. A judge ruled he can argue self-defense.","source":"web","title":"Jordan Miller - The Salt Lake Tribune","url":"https://www.sltrib.com/staff/jordanmiller/"},{"date":"2026-10-07","id":68,"last_updated":"2026-10-11","snippet":"# Jordan Miller\n## Reporter\n#### He’s accused of murder in a Salt Lake City LDS church shooting. A judge ruled he can argue self-defense.","source":"web","title":"Jordan Miller - The Salt Lake Tribune","url":"https://www.sltrib.com/author/jordanmiller/"},{"id":69,"last_updated":"2026-10-25","snippet":"# Utah \u0026 U.S. Police \u0026 Court News\n## Car fire at Salt Lake City International Airport damages 12 vehicles\n#### Joe R. Wirthlin Jr, KSL | Posted Oct. 23 - 4:01 p.m. | Save Story\n##### A car fire began early Friday morning at the Salt Lake City International Airport economy parking lot, damaging 12 vehicles. Fire officials are investigating the cause as an electrical malfunction.","source":"web","title":"Police \u0026 Courts","url":"https://www.ksl.com/news/utah/police-and-courts"},{"date":"2026-10-25","id":70,"last_updated":"2026-10-25","snippet":"# Crime \u0026 safety\n## Latest\n### Judge sends No Kings volunteer to trial for manslaughter in bystander's death\nMatthew Alder, 43, is accused of firing the shot that killed Arthur \"Afa\" Ah Loo at the 2025 Salt Lake City protest while aiming at a man carrying a rifle.","source":"web","title":"Crime \u0026 safety | The Utah Ledger","url":"https://utahledger.com/section/crime"},{"date":"2026-10-25","id":71,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Utah News - Breaking news and updates - The Salt Lake Tribune\n...\n# News\n## Navajo Nation communities ordered to evacuate ahead of expected flooding\n### SLC Council votes to preserve green space at Ballpark site after input from residents","source":"web","title":"Utah News - Breaking news and updates - The Salt Lake Tribune","url":"https://www.sltrib.com/news/"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":72,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Salt Lake City, UT Breaking News Headlines Today | Ground News\nMonday, October 26, 2026Set Location","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake City, UT Breaking News Headlines Today","url":"https://ground.news/interest/salt-lake-city"},{"id":73,"last_updated":"2026-10-24","snippet":"# Salt Lake County Breaking News \u0026 Latest Stories\n## South Salt Lake crews investigate State Street structure fire\n#### Devin Oldroyd, KSL | Posted Oct. 8 - 9:16 p.m. | Save Story\n##### Firefighters in South Salt Lake responded to a structure fire on State Street Thursday evening. No injuries were reported. The cause has yet to be determined.","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake County Breaking News \u0026 Local Stories | KSL","url":"https://www.ksl.com/news/utah/counties/salt-lake/page/7"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":74,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"## Latest Stories\n#### Voices: Eight hours after being in crisis, I was expected to return to normal life. We need better mental health support.\nBy Emilee Swensen | For The Salt Lake Tribune | October 26, 2026, 12:05 p.m.","source":"web","title":"Latest - The Salt Lake Tribune","url":"https://www.sltrib.com/latest/"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":75,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26 | KSL.com","source":"web","title":"Browse by Day Archive | 2026/10/26 | KSL.com","url":"https://www.ksl.com/archive/2026/10/26/_news_features_lifestyle"}],"type":"search_results"},"output_index":2,"sequence_number":17,"type":"response.output_item.done"}

