data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_47c59cfe-060f-4ad1-85ab-ce38a14b2761","output_index":8,"sequence_number":507,"text":"Here’s the Salt Lake City–area snapshot for **Monday, Oct. 26, 2026**:\n\n- **Stalking arrest:** Salt Lake City police arrested a 49-year-old Alaska man accused of secretly tracking his ex-girlfriend’s vehicle and following her to a city hotel. He was booked on a felony stalking charge and held without bail. [ABC4/Yahoo](https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/articles/man-stalks-ex-girlfriend-alaska-014246085.html)\n- **Fatal police shooting under investigation:** In nearby West Valley City, an officer fatally shot a man Sunday after hotel employees reportedly found him in a storage building with a metal rod. Witnesses said he charged an officer; West Jordan police are investigating, and the officer is on administrative leave. [KSL](https://www.ksl.com/article/51640813/man-dies-after-being-shot-by-police-outside-of-west-valley-city-hotel-police-say)\n- **Madsen Park closed today** for construction of new community amenities. The city expects it to reopen in spring 2027. [Salt Lake City](https://www.slc.gov/blog/category/latest-news/)\n- **Weather:** Mostly sunny with a high around **65°F**. A weak cold front could bring rain between roughly 9 p.m. and 3 a.m., with a low near 44°F. [National Weather Service](https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?textField1=40.76083\u0026textField2=-111.89028)\n- **Tonight’s major events:** The **Utah Jazz host the Memphis Grizzlies at 7 p.m.** at the Delta Center. Dinosaur Jr. plays The Complex, and *Little Shop of Horrors* is at Pioneer Theatre. [AP](https://apnews.com/article/memphis-grizzlies-utah-jazz-utah-memphis-5d286dee2f604d6cb404d088e41d8f1f) · [KSL Events](https://www.ksl.com/events/details/592565?date=2026-10-26)\n\nNo single major citywide emergency appears to dominate today’s Salt Lake City news; the most serious metro-area story is the West Valley City shooting investigation.","type":"response.output_text.done"}

