2026 | KSL Events - Local Events in Utah\n1. Sports \u0026 Outdoors\n2. Halloween Lift Rides 2026\n# Halloween Lift Rides 2026\nSundance Resort\n8841 N.\nAlpine Loop Road , Provo\nOct 26, 2026 at 7:00pmSee Additional Dates\nJust like the Full Moon Lift Ride, but a little spookier!\nGet in the Spirit of Halloween and enjoy a 30-45 minute ride on Outlaw Express Lift, perfect for date nights and family activities (geared to be family friendly we recommend kids 10+).\nEnjoy Halloween treats, hot chocolate, food, and concess\n...\n## Similar Events\nOct26\n## Halloween Lift Rides 2026\nSundance Resort\nProvo | 7:00pm","source":"web","title":"Halloween Lift Rides 2026","url":"https://www.ksl.com/events/details/599498"}],"type":"search_results"},{"queries":["Salt Lake City police fire crash October 26 2026","Salt Lake City breaking incident October 26 2026","Salt Lake County crime news October 26 2026"],"results":[{"date":"2026-10-26","id":61,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City\n...\n# Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City\n...\nMon, October 26, 2026 at 1:42 AM UTC\n...\nSALT LAKE COUNTY, Utah (**ABC4**) — A man was was arrested in Salt Lake City for stalking, after following his ex-girlfriend from Alaska to Utah.\nSteven Samuelson, a 49 year-old male, was arrested on one count of stalking, a third-degree felony.\n...\nSalt Lake City Police arrived and detained Samuelson, and he revealed that he tracked the victim's vehicle through a small tracking device.\n...\nSamuelson is currently being held at the Salt Lake County jail without a bail.","source":"web","title":"Man stalks ex-girlfriend from Alaska, arrested in Salt Lake City","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/articles/man-stalks-ex-girlfriend-alaska-014246085.html"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":62,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Salt Lake City Shooting Suspect Charged Over Loud Music Fight\nMonday, October 26, 2026Set L