andy\n...\n.MONDAY...Partly cloudy in the morning then becoming sunny.\nHighs\nin the mid 60s.\nSouth winds 10 to 20 mph.\n.MONDAY NIGHT...\nPartly cloudy in the evening, then mostly cloudy\nwith a 40 percent chance of rain after midnight.\nLows in the\nlower 40s.","source":"web","title":"Current Version","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=NWS\u0026issuedby=SLC\u0026product=ZFP\u0026format=CI\u0026version=1\u0026glossary=1"},{"id":104,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"Mon, 26 Oct\n19 / 7 °C\nMostly cloudy.\nFeels Like: 18 °C\nHumidity: 35%\nPrecipitation: Rain: 0mm Snow: 0mm\nPrecipitation Chance: 2%\n...\n| |Conditions|Conditions|Conditions|Comfort|Comfort|Comfort|Comfort|Precipitation|Precipitation|Sun|Sun|Sun|\n|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|--|\n|Day| |Temperature|Weather|Feels Like|Wind| |Humidity|Chance|Amount|UV|Sunrise|Sunset|\n|Mon 26 Oct| |19 / 7 °C|Mostly cloudy.|18 °C|23 km/h|↑|35%|2%|0.0 mm|3(Moderate)|07:51|18:31|","source":"web","title":"Salt Lake City, Utah, USA 14 day weather forecast - Time and Date","url":"https://www.timeanddate.com/weather/usa/salt-lake-city/ext"},{"date":"2026-10-26","id":105,"last_updated":"2026-10-26","snippet":"National Weather Service Salt Lake City UT\n1242 PM MDT Sun Oct 25 2026\nThis is an automatically-generated product based on a\nrepresentative point or points within each forecast zone.\nThe\nforecast may not be representative of the exact location you are\ninterested in.\nFor a more specific forecast, please visit\nweather.gov/slc and\n(1) click a location on the map\n...\n(2) type a location into the upper-left corner of the page.\nUTZ105-261200-\nSalt Lake Valley-\nIncluding Salt Lake City, West Jordan, and Sandy\n1242 PM MDT Sun Oct 25 2026\n.TONIGHT...Mostly clear.\nLows in the lower 40s.\n.MONDAY...Partly cloudy in the morning then becoming sunny.\nHighs\nin the mid 60s.\nSouth winds 10 to 20 mph.\n.MONDAY NIGHT...\nPartly cloudy in the evening, then mostly cloudy\nwith a 40 percent chance of rain after midnight.\nLows in the\nlower 40s.\n...\nChance of rain","source":"web","title":"National Weather Service","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=slc\u0026issuedby=SLC\u0026product=ZFP"}],"type":"search_results"},{"content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"Here’s the Salt Lake City–area snapshot for **Monday, Oct. 26, 2026**:\n\n- **Stalking arrest:** Salt Lake City police arrested a 49-year-old Alaska man accused of secretly tracking his ex-girlfriend’s vehicle and following her to a city hotel. He was booked on a felony stalking charge and held without bail. [ABC4/Yahoo](https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/articles/man-stalks-ex-girlfriend-alaska-014246085.html)\n- **Fatal police shooting under investigation:** In nearby West Valley City, an officer fatally shot a man Sunday after hotel employees reportedly found him in a storage building with a metal rod. Witnesses said he charged an officer; West Jordan police are investigating, and the officer is on administrative leave. [KSL](https://www.ksl.com/article/51640813/man-dies-after-being-shot-by-police-outside-of-west-valley-city-hotel-police-say)\n- **Madsen Park closed today** for construction of new community amenities. The city expects it to reopen in spring 2027. [Salt Lake City](https://www.slc.gov/blog/category/latest-news/)\n- **Weather:** Mostly sunny with a high around **65°F**. A weak cold front could bring rain between roughly 9 p.m. and 3 a.m., with a low near 44°F. [National Weather Service](https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?textField1=40.76083\u0026textField2=-111.89028)\n- **Tonight’s major events:** The **Utah Jazz host the Memphis Grizzlies at 7 p.m.** at the Delta Center. Dinosaur Jr. plays The Complex, and *Little Shop of Horrors* is at Pioneer Theatre. [AP](https://apnews.com/article/memphis-grizzlies-utah-jazz-utah-memphis-5d286dee2f604d6cb404d088e41d8f1f) · [KSL Events](https://www.ksl.com/events/details/592565?date=2026-10-26)\n\nNo single major citywide emergency appears to dominate today’s Salt Lake City news; the most serious metro-area story is the West Valley City shooting investigation.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_47c59cfe-060f-4ad1-85ab-ce38a14b2761","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"}},"tool_choice":"auto","tools":[{"type":"web_search"}],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":1,"truncation":"","usage":{"cost":{"cache_creation_cost":0.14119,"cache_read_cost":0.01002,"currency":"USD","input_cost":0.00197,"output_cost":0.02958,"tool_calls_cost":0.02,"tool_calls_cost_details":{"search_web":0.02},"total_cost":0.20276},"input_tokens":53791,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":28237,"cache_read_input_tokens":25062,"cached_tokens":25062},"output_tokens":1479,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":412},"tool_calls_details":{"search_web":{"cost_usd":0.02,"invocation":8}},"total_tokens":55270},"user":null},"sequence_number":509,"type":"response.completed"}

